#, no-c-format
msgid "Immediately"
msgstr "Inmediatamente"

#: rc.cpp:104 rc.cpp:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can change the delay after which the panel will disappear if not "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Eiquí pódese cambia-lo retardo despois do cal ocultarase o panel se non se "
"emprega."

#: rc.cpp:106
